{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>They did not recognize him</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here, and the other regarding Job, ויראו אותו מרחוק ולא הכירוהו. Just as there they did not recognize him because he had changed on account of suffering, so too here they did not recognize him because he had changed — he had been a slave and became a minister and great in all the land. However, there they did not recognize him from afar, but when they approached him they recognized him; whereas here they did not recognize him at all, for it never entered their minds that Joseph could reach such a stature."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:13.161259732Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}